      "reviewerVerdict": "hold",
      "preparedCanonicalPersonId": "per_5T755BG3EGBTXSA6KBZ9",
      "reviewerReason": "HOLD: liangshu:014:p079 name claims 劉峻/孝標 seal evidence liangshu:014:s0229, but s0229 has no matching Chinese name (陸大夫燕喜西都，郭有道人倫東國，公卿貴其籍甚，搢…). Author attribution for the quoted 廣絕交論 block is introduced at s0193「平原劉孝標爲著論曰」, yet the sealed person has no zh mention spans on s0193, so native primary-witness rules cannot certify this local person on the current extraction graph. Retain canonical uncertainty; do not treat bounded Liu Jun overflow as separation evidence.",
      "ownerDisposition": "resolve-by-retire-p079-merge-graph-into-p058",
      "sourceWitnesses": [
        {
          "localId": "liangshu:014:p079",
          "book": "liangshu",
          "chapter": "014",
          "unitId": "s0193",
          "quote": "平原劉孝標"
        },
        {
          "localId": "liangshu:014:p079",
          "book": "liangshu",
          "chapter": "014",
          "unitId": "s0229",
          "quote": "陸大夫"
        }
      ],
      "primaryChinese": [
        {
          "unitId": "s0193",
          "zh": "平原劉孝標爲著論曰：",
          "literal": "Liu Xiaobiao of Pingyuan wrote a discourse, saying:",
          "idiomatic": "Liu Xiaobiao of Pingyuan wrote a discourse, saying:"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "s0229",
          "zh": "陸大夫燕喜西都，郭有道人倫東國，公卿貴其籍甚，搢紳羨其登仙。",
          "literal": "Grand Master Lu feasted in the western capital; Guo the Worthy ranked men in the eastern state; dukes and ministers prized his great fame, gentry envied his ascent to immortals.",
          "idiomatic": "Grand Master Lu feasted in the western capital; Guo the Worthy ranked men in the eastern state; nobles prized his fame, gentry envied his ascent among immortals."
        }
      ],
      "resolution": "Retire false local person p079 (劉峻/Xiaobiao name evidence wrongly on s0229). Keep p058 劉孝標 with explicit s0193 witness; extend p058 attribution to quoted discourse s0193–s0278; re-point quoted-source speaker edges from p079→p058 and p109 relation hint p079→p058.",
      "affectedCaseIds": [
        "sha256:067dce2f4ce3f0b2d222af2a6fad5689e98912a68c64539e4b9f12b700d4264f"
      ]
    }
  ],
